## Interface: 11509, 20506, 16001
## Title: Spoken Books
## Notes: Books, letters and notes read aloud through Spoken.
## Notes-deDE: Bücher, Briefe und Notizen werden über Spoken vorgelesen.
## Notes-esES: Libros, cartas y notas leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken.
## Notes-esMX: Libros, cartas y notas leídos en voz alta a través de Spoken.
## Notes-frFR: Livres, lettres et notes lus à voix haute grâce à Spoken.
## Notes-ptBR: Livros, cartas e notas lidos em voz alta através do Spoken.
## Notes-ruRU: Книги, письма и заметки, озвученные через Spoken.
## Notes-koKR: Spoken으로 책, 편지, 메모를 소리내어 읽습니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 通过 Spoken 朗读书籍、信件和笔记。
## Notes-zhTW: 透過 Spoken 朗讀書籍、信件和筆記。
## Version: 3.4.0
## Author: rusty
## SavedVariables: SpokenBooksSettings
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: SpokenBooksCharacter
# Two tables, because they answer different questions. SpokenBooksSettings is how you like the
# addon to behave and is yours; SpokenBooksCharacter is what a particular character has heard,
# so an alt walking into the same library is read to rather than met with silence.
## Dependencies: Spoken
# Spoken is what this module runs on, and ships in the same zip.
## OptionalDeps: SpokenBooksAudio
# The pack is not a registration mechanism: it registers itself into SpokenBooksAudioPacks and
# Audio.lua walks that on demand, so this is load order only.
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Spoken_Books\Textures\AddonIcon.tga
## Group: Spoken
## X-License: Addon code MIT. Book text is Blizzard's, extracted from the game.

